"/></StackPane></graphic></Button><Button fx:id="botonCancelar" text="CANCELAR INSCRIPCIÓN" onAction="#cancelarInscripcion" disable="true" maxWidth="Infinity" HBox.hgrow="ALWAYS" styleClass="tournament-action-cancel"><graphic><StackPane minWidth="18" prefWidth="18" maxWidth="18" minHeight="18" prefHeight="18" maxHeight="18" styleClass="inscriptions-icon-slot-v4"><SVGPath content="M12 4 C16.4 4 20 7.6 20 12 C20 16.4 16.4 20 12 20 C7.6 20 4 16.4 4 12 C4 7.6 7.6 4 12 4 Z M8 8 L16 16 M16 8 L8 16" styleClass="inscriptions-icon-v4"/></StackPane></graphic></Button></HBox></VBox></bottom>
